{
  "title": { "zh": "∃ 换成函数" },
  "adds": ["skolem"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "子句里只有「对所有」，没有「存在」。已知里的 ∃ 外面没有 ∀ 时，可以像<part-ref to=\"part:exE\"></part-ref>那样取出那一样东西；在 ∀ 底下就不行：「每个人都有父母」，父母随人而变。新元件「Skolem 化」把这样的 ∃ 换成一个<wiki-ref to=\"skolem\"></wiki-ref>，比如 sk1(x)：x 的父母。它只认否定范式里的 ∃。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "Skolem 化前后的已知并不等价，只是同时可满足、同时不可满足，称为<b>等可满足</b>。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "au-skolem",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "becomes",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        {
          "goal": "⊥",
          "hyps": ["∀x. Bird(x) → Flies(x)", "¬∀x. Bird(x) → Flies(x)"],
          "becomes": [["⋀a. ∀x. ¬Bird(x) ∨ Flies(x); Bird(a) ∧ ¬Flies(a) ⊢ ⊥"]]
        },
        { "goal": "⊥", "hyps": ["∀x. ∃y. Parent(y, x)"], "becomes": [["∀x. Parent(sk1(x), x) ⊢ ⊥"]] },
        { "goal": "⊥", "hyps": ["Human(h)", "¬∀x. ∃y. Likes(y, x)"], "becomes": [["⋀a. Human(h); ∀y. ¬Likes(y, a) ⊢ ⊥"]] }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手，把每个目标的已知化成合取范式，再去掉 ∃。"
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "¬∀ 先要化成 ∃¬，∃ 才露出来。" },
        { "zh": "第二个目标里，∃y 在 ∀x 底下：y 跟着 x 变。" }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = iff[use=[\"iff.elim\"]]()",
        "c0r1 = arrow[use=[\"arrow.elim\"]](c0r0)",
        "c0r2 = dneg[use=[\"dneg.elim\"]](c0r1)",
        "c0r3 = dm[use=[\"dm.notOr\", \"dm.notAnd\", \"dm.notEx\", \"dm.notAll\"]](c0r2)",
        "c0r7 = dist[use=[\"dist.orAndR\", \"dist.orAndL\"]](c0r3)",
        "c0 = simp[at=hyps](in, c0r7)",
        "c1 = skolem(c0)",
        "out <- c1"
      ],
      "naive": ["c0 = skolem(in)", "out <- c0"]
    }
  ]
}
